ntent and to do this year a clever  tactic shooting protesters or  specifically having Eleanor his wife and  number two in control of the country or  during the shooting of dissenters in the  city of Timmins awara on December the  21st 1989 Ceausescu gave his speech to a  huge crowd of communist supporters in  order to denounce the protesters one  problem everyone hated him and the crowd  started to boo him and given that this  speech was televised it confirmed to  everyone else in the country how  unpopular the leadership was protest  soon spread across the country in the  next day the church s Jews fled  Bucharest and immediately after this a  provisional government the National  Salvation Front was formed with yoni Li  s cous  seating chart Chesky was president  Alaska was also a communist but he was  critical of Ceausescu in the past and so  had been sidelined and thus was distant  enough from the regime to get the job on  the 24th of December the church s cues  were captured and handed over to the  Army in the next day they were put on  trial for their past actions  now this trial didn't have time for  silly little things like evidence and  Loy's and was frankly little more than a  sham in a verdict that shocked everyone  the couple were found guilty and  sentenced to spend the rest of their  lives in custody  which was literally five minutes because  they were actually sentenced to death  which was to be carried out immediately  at first illy ESCO attempted to maintain  a communist government claiming that the  people had revolted against Ceausescu  but actually like communism  this was not an opinion shared by many  Romanians and protests and violence  continued even after this  illy escu conceded and in 1990 he was  elected with an overwhelming mandate and  he began the process of moving Romania  away from communism to a market economy  remaining his revolution is different to  the other Eastern European ones in a  simple but important way whilst Romania  wa